{
  "id": "GAL.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Gäl 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän min luɔtdä mɛn. Kɛn gaat tin bi nyin gua̱ni guäl, ca kɛ ciɛŋ ce̱tnikɛ kuaany mëë ŋotkɛ kɛ gaat, a cäŋ kɛ kɛn gaat tekɛ ŋɔaani diaal ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ŋot kɛn kɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈, tëëkɛ wutni ti tiɛtkɛ kɛ, amäni cäŋ in ci gua̱n ɛ lar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɛn ta̱a̱ ëë tekɛ kɔn, mëë ŋot kɔn kɛ gaat, lapnɛ kuaany yieeni tin ruackɛ ɣɔaa ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci gua̱a̱th in ro̱ŋ cop, cu Kuoth Gatdɛ ja̱k, cua jɛ dap ɛ ciek, dapkɛ jɛ piny ŋutdä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö bɛ nɛy tin te piny ŋutdä kän, kɛ ɣöö dee kɔn ciöt ni ɣöö gaat Kuɔth mi dɔap jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö lapɛ gaat, ci Kuoth Yiëë Gatdɛ jäkä rɛy lo̱cnikɔn, min wiee i̱, “Abba! Guä!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, ji̱n /ci lɛ ŋot ala kuany, ɛ ji̱n gat, kä mi lapi gat, akuoth bɛ ji̱ ka̱m ti diaal tin tekɛ jɛ kɛ kui̱ gatdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diɛɛr Puɔl kɛ ji̱ Gä-lëë-cia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëëdan, mëë kui̱c yɛn Kuoth, cu yɛn a kuaany kä ti /ci tɔ̱a̱ kuth ti thuɔ̱ɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ min cia ben a cia Kuoth ŋa̱c, kiɛ kɛ ɣöö ba yɛ ŋa̱c ɛ Kuoth, ɛŋu dee yɛn rɔ̱ nyɔk kɛ loc jɔk kä ti jiäk ɔ tin la ruëëc yieeni ti jiäk ɔ? Ɛŋu go̱o̱r yɛn, ɣöö bi yɛn rɔ̱ nyɔk ala kuaanykiɛn ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋot yɛn tiit yɛn ni̱n, kɛ päth, kɛ gua̱th runä, kɛnɛ run! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän dualä kɛ yɛ ɛn ɣöö la̱tdä min cä lät kä yɛ ba baŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dämaari, ɣän la̱ŋä yɛ, gɔaani ɣöö bia ce̱tkɛ ɣä, kɛ ɣöö bä cu ce̱tkɛ yɛ bä. Thilɛ duer mi cia lät kä ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋäc yɛn ɛŋu cä yɛ la̱t thuk ti gɔw kɛ nhiam ɔ, ɛ ɣöö ta̱a̱ kɛ juey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a cäŋ ni mëë jueydä ɛ riɛk kä yɛ, /ken yɛn ɣä buy, kä /ken yɛn ɣä lo̱k, kä duundɛ ɣöö ci yɛn nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r ni ɣä agɔaa ce̱tkɛ mi nyuur yɛn ni jääk nhial, kä ce̱tkɛ mi nyuur yɛn ni Yecu Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu ci tuɔɔk ɔ kä tɛ̈th lɔaac ëëdan? Kä ɣän puɔ̱nydä dëë wee dee yɛn wäŋkun lööl raar kä dërɛ kɛ ka̱m ɣä mi lotdɛ rɔ ɛ nëë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn täämɛ, ci ɣän a gua̱n tɛ̈run, kɛ ɣöö cä yɛ la̱t ruac mi thuɔ̱k? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ pɛ̈lkɛ ni yɛ, kä /ciɛ kui̱ kä mi gɔaa. Go̱o̱r kɛn ni ɣöö da̱kɛ ni kɔn, kɛ ɣöö bia kulɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gɔaa ɛ ɛn ɣöö dee naath yɛ go̱r kɛ kui̱ kä mi gɔaa gua̱thni diaal, kä /ciɛ gua̱a̱th in ta̱a̱ kɛɛl kɛ yɛ kärɔa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaatkä tin tɔatni, ce̱tkɛ min la mäc dapä a bɛc kä ciek, ɛ jɛ bɛ̈c in tekɛ ɣä kɛ kui̱dun amäni mi ci ciaaŋ Kritho cop lɔɔcdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dëë go̱r ni mi ta̱a̱ kɛɛl kɛ yɛ ɛn täämɛ a dëë duɔ̱ɔ̱p in ruackɛ ɣä päl, kɛ ɣöö kuecä mɔ dëë carɔ kɛ kui̱dun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth A-gar kɛnɛ Thara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La̱rɛ jɛ ɣä, yɛn nɛy tin nhɔakɛ ɣöö bia cieŋ kɛ ŋut, a /ci yɛn ŋut bi ku liŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca jɛ gɔ̱r ɛn ɣöö te A-bɛ-ram kɛ dhɔɔl da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛl ɛ gat ciëk mi kuany, kä min dɔ̱ŋ ɛ gat ciëk mi lɔr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gat ciëk in kuany dapkɛ jɛ kɛ ta̱a̱ ri̱eŋ, kä gat ciëk in lɔr dapkɛ jɛ kɛ ruac mi ca larɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, nɛmɛ ɛ ruac cäätdä, kɛn män da̱ŋ rɛw ti̱ti̱ kɛ mat ruaacni Kuɔth da̱ŋ rɛw. Ciek kɛl ɛ A-gar, kä bëë kä Päm Thi-nay, daapɛ gaat kɛ kui̱ kuaanyä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ jɛn A-gar ɛ Päm Thi-nay rɛy rööl Ä-rab-ya, kä jɛn lotdɛ ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mɛ täämɛ, kɛ ɣöö cieŋɛ kuaanyä kɛnɛ gaatkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ciek in dɔ̱ŋ lotdɛ ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm min te nhial. Jɛn lɔrɛ, kä ɛ jɛn mandan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ica 54:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
